@startuml
' Phase 4 — Sifter: as-built. Copy of plan.uml edited to what was actually built.

title Phase 4 — Sifter (as built)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "aa-sifter (Python, sifter/src/aa_sifter)" as sifter {
  component "app (ComputeSifter orchestration)" as app
  component "contracts (aa_contracts bridge)" as bridge
  component "rpc (JSON-RPC 2.0, in-process)" as rpc
  component "decisions (classify + approval + rules)" as decisions
  component "routing (preflight + policy + budget)" as routing
  component "context (handoff + redaction + sizing)" as context
  component "models (Ollama/OpenAI-compatible/DeepSeek)" as models
  component "catalog + recommend + system" as recommend
  component "tasks (DAG + executor)" as tasks
  component "verification" as verify
  component "metrics (usage + trace)" as metrics
  component "memory (MemorySink, Nop default)" as memory
  component "history (SQLite)" as history
  component "cli + desktop (migrated)" as surfaces
}

package "aa-contracts (Python bindings)" as contracts

contracts --> bridge : route / memory schemas (optional import)

rpc --> bridge
rpc --> app
app --> decisions
app --> routing
app --> context
app --> models
app --> tasks
app --> verify
app --> metrics
app --> memory
app --> history
surfaces --> app
recommend --> models

note right of context
  As built (ADR-P4-003):
  _call_tier redacts every expert-tier
  request; generate, preflight and
  decompose also redact. Local calls
  are unchanged.
end note

note bottom of routing
  As built: fit_messages bounds context,
  max_output_tokens is forwarded, budget
  estimates are pre-flight, and cost
  waivers / rule grants are wired.
end note

note bottom of rpc
  As built: sifter.route (no model),
  sifter.generate, sifter.health, and
  additive sifter.recommend. Transport
  hosting deferred.
end note

note bottom of memory
  As built: each run emits a validated
  memory_record candidate. Nop default;
  the aa-memory writer is deferred.
end note

@enduml
